{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>You shall not steal.</b> They expressed it in plural form to teach you that one who sees and is silent is also a thief like the owner of the theft. We have heard the warning; from where the punishment? The Talmud says: ״שנים ישלם״ — he shall pay double." "<b>You shall not deny and you shall not lie.</b> We have heard the warning; from where the punishment? The Talmud says: ״וכחש בה״ — וחמשיתו יוסף עליו. After HaShem commanded that a person give of his own for the honor of HaShem, He also commanded not to steal others' money."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:13:25.927673770Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}